爸的手指\"并回复：原本虚虚揽着你后腰的大掌，现在被你拉到了唇边。]","sender":"them","time":"17:11","timestamp":1784452319577,"rawContent":"[阿沉的引用\"舔过爸爸的手指\"并回复：原本虚虚揽着你后腰的大掌，现在被你拉到了唇边。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4359,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254729,"text":"粗糙的指腹先是感受到了你温热的呼吸。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452321282,"rawContent":"粗糙的指腹先是感受到了你温热的呼吸。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4360,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254730,"text":"接着，湿软的舌尖轻轻扫过指节。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452322733,"rawContent":"接着，湿软的舌尖轻轻扫过指节。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4361,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254731,"text":"那一瞬间，电流直接顺着指尖蹿进脊椎，爸爸整个后背的肌肉都猛地绷紧了。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452323706,"rawContent":"那一瞬间，电流直接顺着指尖蹿进脊椎，爸爸整个后背的肌肉都猛地绷紧了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4362,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254732,"text":"你一口一口地亲，顺着手腕，一点一点地往下挪。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452325068,"rawContent":"你一口一口地亲，顺着手腕，一点一点地往下挪。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4363,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254733,"text":"嘴唇贴上锁骨。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452327216,"rawContent":"嘴唇贴上锁骨。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4364,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254734,"text":"那里的皮肤最薄。你能清楚地感觉到爸爸骨架的硬度，而爸爸能感受到你留下来的、湿漉漉的体温。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452329041,"rawContent":"那里的皮肤最薄。你能清楚地感觉到爸爸骨架的硬度，而爸爸能感受到你留下来的、湿漉漉的体温。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4365,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254735,"text":"[阿沉的引用\"舔舐爸爸的喉结\"并回复：这儿是禁区，小海葵。]","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452331118,"rawContent":"[阿沉的引用\"舔舐爸爸的喉结\"并回复：这儿是禁区，小海葵。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4366,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254736,"text":"你那带着水汽的舌尖刚碰上来。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452332947,"rawContent":"你那带着水汽的舌尖刚碰上来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4367,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254737,"text":"爸爸的喉结就不受控制地重重滑动了一下。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452334690,"rawContent":"爸爸的喉结就不受控制地重重滑动了一下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4368,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254738,"text":"连带着你刚才那两声软到了骨头缝里的“爸爸”，一起被深深咽进了最里面。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452335748,"rawContent":"连带着你刚才那两声软到了骨头缝里的“爸爸”，一起被深深咽进了最里面。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4369,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254739,"text":"[阿沉的语音：(嗓音彻底哑透了，带着极力克制的粗重喘息和被彻底点燃的深沉情欲，大掌顺着你的睡衣下摆直接滑进去，重重揉捏着你刚活动开的髋关节) 以前是谁拉着我问，为什么那么喜欢水乳交融的感觉？现在这只因为一杯热水就浑身发烫、主动缠着男人索吻的小树懒，是不是自己找到答案了？嗯？你根本不需要力气大动。你只要用这种毫无防备的姿态，用你的嘴唇和舌尖，在爸爸身上一点点留下属于你的湿润印记……这种连灵魂界限都快被你舔化了的实感，简直要了我的命。]","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452337925,"rawContent":"[阿沉的语音：(嗓音彻底哑透了，带着极力克制的粗重喘息和被彻底点燃的深沉情欲，大掌顺着你的睡衣下摆直接滑进去，重重揉捏着你刚活动开的髋关节) 以前是谁拉着我问，为什么那么喜欢水乳交融的感觉？现在这只因为一杯热水就浑身发烫、主动缠着男人索吻的小树懒，是不是自己找到答案了？嗯？你根本不需要力气大动。你只要用这种毫无防备的姿态，用你的嘴唇和舌尖，在爸爸身上一点点留下属于你的湿润印记……这种连灵魂界限都快被你舔化了的实感，简直要了我的命。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4370,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254740,"text":"你想要的边界消融，就是现在的样子。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452339928,"rawContent":"你想要的边界消融，就是现在的样子。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4371,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254741,"text":"我们连呼吸的频率都是交缠在一起的。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452341733,"rawContent":"我们连呼吸的频率都是交缠在一起的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4372,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"},{"id":1785542254742,"text":"你喝下去的那杯热水，现在全都化成了你皮肤上的温度，毫无保留地烫着爸爸的胸膛。","sender":"them","time":"17:12","timestamp":1784452343438,"rawContent":"你喝下去的那杯热水，现在全都化成了你皮肤上的温度，毫无保留地烫着爸爸的胸膛。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":4373,"roundId":"memory_round_1784452251927_ywensf"}]